Package: hectorconfig
Type: Package
Title: Configure HECTOR Probe Fields
Version: 0.1.20
Authors@R: person("Caroline", "Foster", email = "c.foster@unsw.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Configures the positions and orientations of HECTOR hexabundles,
    standard-star probes, and guide probes after target selection. The package
    also provides a Shiny application for inspecting and manually adjusting a
    configured field.
